### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/health

### Create authorized payment
POST http://localhost:3000/payments/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
idempotency-key: demo-payment-001

{
  "merchantId": "mrc_intercorp_001",
  "customerId": "cus_1001",
  "amount": 120.50,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### Create high amount payment rejected by policy
POST http://localhost:3000/payments/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
idempotency-key: demo-payment-002

{
  "merchantId": "mrc_intercorp_001",
  "customerId": "cus_1002",
  "amount": 6500,
  "currency": "USD"
}

### List payments
GET http://localhost:3000/payments/v1/payments?limit=20

### Get payment by id
GET http://localhost:3000/payments/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}

### Capture payment
POST http://localhost:3000/payments/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/capture

### Refund payment
POST http://localhost:3000/payments/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/refund
